3. Data and assets
------------------

Test images
  test-images/04 to 18 are synthetic images made by American Dream
  Network for the Separation Table (its scripts/make-test-images.py, no
  third-party content), covered by the MIT License
  (test-images/SOURCES.md). scripts/make-targets.mjs draws the test
  targets from shapes.

Garment colours (src/garments.js)
  ADN's own estimates of common blank colours. No third-party data.

Printer presets (src/machines.js)
  Platen sizes, resolutions and file formats restated from the makers'
  published documents, each cited by URL in the preset's `sources`;
  values without a source are marked "default, verify". No vendor
  files, profiles or documentation are copied in.

src/assets/brand/
  The tool marks shared with the Separation Table, made by ADN. The
  PNGs and favicon.ico are rendered from the SVGs. The ADN name and
  logo are trademarks of American Dream Network and are not covered by
  the MIT License grant.

Printer and RIP product names (Epson, Garment Creator 2, Brother GTX
Graphics Lab, Kornit, ColorGate, CADlink) are named only to say
which software loads the
files. No vendor files, profiles or documentation are copied in.
Product names are trademarks of their owners.

Fonts: none bundled.


